Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 00:34:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] =?UTF-8?q?Show=20the=20emulator=20as=20Aub=C3=A9pine?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20(window=20title,=20menus,=20dialogs,=20version);=20eglantine?=
 =?UTF-8?q?.exe?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

As in the PokeDinner-based fork: the visible name is Aubépine, the executable keeps the name
eglantine.exe, and the update repository points at pattex67/Aubepine (the update checker stays
off in our builds). Kept on purpose: the hotkey id, QCoreApplication's application name, the eden
data folder and the GitHub/Lichii links.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
